{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42336","headline":"进雪诗 · 徐铉","name":"进雪诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲使新正识有年，故飘轻絮伴春还。\n近看琼树笼银阙，远想瑶池带玉关。\n润逐麳麰铺绿野，暖随杯酒上朱颜。\n朝来花萼楼中宴，数曲赓歌雅颂间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}